07 per share, a year earlier. The increase was mostly due to a $5.9 billion one-time noncash tax benefit.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c0a4e8c3a156a024\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 25, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cnbc.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d42f4c488e3745cf\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla (TSLA) Q4 and FY 2023 earnings results: Total revenue at $25.1B and EPS at $0.71\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d42f4c488e3745cf\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.teslarati.com/tesla-tsla-q4-fy-2023-earnings-results-update-letter/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3cfba55230a508a6\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nNon-GAAP earnings per share for full year 2023 was listed at $3.12, while GAAP EPS for FY 2023 was listed at $4.30. Tesla’s operating income decreased year-over-year to <strong>$2.1 billion</strong> in the fourth quarter, resulting in an 8.2% operating margin.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3cfba55230a508a6\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 24, 2024\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.teslarati.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"311f435f9638a4e0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTesla Q4 earnings: Net income surges 59% to $3.7B - Automotive News\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"311f435f9638a4e0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.autonews.com/earnings-reports/tesla-q4-earnings-net-income-surges-59-37b/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"137fd2840ecf3dcf\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe EV maker reported revenue of <strong>$24.3 billion</strong> in the fourth quarter, above analyst estimates, but put delivery growth at 37 percent for 2023 compared with a previous forecast of 50 percent.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"137fd2840ecf3dcf\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 26, 2023\",\n    